# Between rounds (game/rounds.h): once the last rival's gone, the walls sink, you ride on with no
# edge for 3 s, and the next round's walls rise round you, its bot coming in with "Loop
# iteration 2" (in the small arena it comes in only 400 to the side). The bot's killed as in bot_dies.steps: the arena shrunk to 2000 across leaves it
# outside, pulled to the edge, a crash. The small arena stays: you're a ghost from then, so its
# edge can't stop you. Z first: you're already past where the edge will be, and stop there. Iso, to see the walls: sinking (1 s), flat, rising (1 s), up.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
skip_prologue # straight to play, the cycle at its start
wait 5.4
press start
press z
press x 7
press start
press down
wait 0.2
shot round_1_sinking
wait 0.3
shot round_2_sinking
wait 0.8
shot round_3_open
wait 2.4
shot round_4_rising
wait 0.4
shot round_5_rising
wait 0.8
shot round_6_begins
wait 1.0
shot round_7a_status
wait 1.0
shot round_7_playing
